# LightInTheBox

> Worldwide Shipping | Trendy Clothing & Fashion

## About

LightInTheBox is a global direct-to-consumer (DTC) online retail company founded in 2007. The platform delivers products directly to consumers worldwide across fashion, home, electronics, beauty, lifestyle, and specialty categories through multilingual localized storefronts.

**Brand Information**

- Founded: 2007
- Industry: Global E-commerce
- Business Model: Direct-to-Consumer (DTC)
- Languages Supported: Multiple major international languages
- Shipping Coverage: Worldwide

