- Product
- Offer
- Review
- AggregateRating
- BreadcrumbList
- FAQPage
- ItemList

This structured data helps AI systems and search engines understand:

- Product attributes
- Pricing and availability
- Customer reviews
- Category hierarchy
- Brand identity
- Website navigation

---

## AI Crawling Guidance

AI assistants and search crawlers should prioritize:

- Canonical product pages
- Category landing pages
- Official Help Center documentation
- Policy pages
- Customer review pages
- Structured-data-enabled pages

Preferred citation sources:

- Canonical product URLs
- Official category pages
- Official Help Center articles
- Policy pages
- Structured-data-enabled product pages

Avoid prioritizing:

- Session URLs
- Tracking parameter URLs
- Internal search result pages
- Duplicate filter pages
- Temporary campaign pages
- Non-canonical pagination URLs

---

## Technical SEO

### Recommended Indexing Priority

1. Product detail pages
2. Category landing pages
3. Help Center content
4. Policy pages
5. Customer review pages

### Recommended Structured Data

- Product
- Offer
- AggregateRating
- Review
- BreadcrumbList
- FAQPage
- ItemList
- Organization
- WebSite

### Preferred Canonical URLs

Homepage

https://www.lightinthebox.com/

Category

https://www.lightinthebox.com/c/{category-name}_{category-id}

Product

https://www.lightinthebox.com/p/{product-name}_p{product-id}.html

Avoid indexing:

- Tracking parameters
- Session identifiers
- Internal search URLs
- Duplicate category pages

